# Route: guide 45 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to
# 60, 50 quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Dustwallow Marsh, Stranglethorn Vale, The Barrens, Stonetalon
# Mountains, Un'Goro Crater, Arathi Highlands, Eastern Plaguelands,
# Winterspring): The Quagmire -> Theramore Isle -> The Quagmire -> Theramore
# Isle -> Brackenwall Village -> Theramore Isle -> Booty Bay -> The Merchant
# Coast -> Ratchet -> Webwinder Path -> Windshear Crag -> Webwinder Path ->
# Windshear Crag -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Shadowshard Fragments (7070;
# Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer
# 38); High Chief Winterfall (5121; High Chief Winterfall 59); The Final Piece
# (5123; High Chief Winterfall 59).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Tiara of the Deep (2846), Mortality Wanes (1142), Willix
# the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate
# Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981),
# Vyletongue Corruption (7041), Corruption of Earth and Seed (7065), Dawn's
# Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The Active Agent (5213), The
# Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243), The Archivist (5251),
# Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282), Menethil's Gift (5463),
# Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Dead Man's Plea (8945), Anthion's Old Friend
# (8948), Drakefire Amulet (6502).

